1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,263
The characters.

2
00:00:01,263 --> 00:00:12,734
Watch the young man's verbs in the first half: he senses disapproval, resents advice, assumes why the boy's head is shaved, suspects the old man of annoying him on purpose.

3
00:00:12,734 --> 00:00:16,471
He reads the street like a text, from a distance.

4
00:00:16,471 --> 00:00:25,494
His wife has fewer lines but more courage: she makes the first friendly touch, and at the birth Winton gives her all the heroic words.

